  "name": "Collector Chest",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Collector Chests are English products released once or twice a year, in spring or summer and in the fall. Each holds five or six booster packs, a coin and sticker sheets, most also a mini portfolio, and two or three foil copies of cards from a recent set, often its starter Pokémon or their evolutions, that no booster pack has: cosmos holofoil for most, mirage holofoil for summer 2023 and pixel cosmos holofoil for fall 2025. The chests here run from spring 2020 to fall 2025.",
